<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">HEB - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">IBURU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu O Ka Laa Iburu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iburu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iburu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kwupu Ungwu O Ka La IBURU</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupwu ungwu Iburu ɔ ka la uzhi uwu wambwalu umba bɔkɔ ɔ gyite lɔ lafya la Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma kwuwongu inyashi iyi o yi mu imama. Onzu uwu a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ le a zɔ yi mba gedegede tee Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba a nyɔlɔ iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a ka e shi mɛzhi ngbaa mu iyemo le. E wo ɛlɛ kaa la kamba ɛnwu ma. Mu isomo wu ɛlɛ, a wa laa eyi ɛla: Iyi kwonze, Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo uwu a vɔngɔ ilomo iyi ongbulolo laa Ada mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ e yidu a ma. Mu kwunzu wu ungwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo, Ɔzhizɔsi a ka anukenzu umba luzɛ undekyi mbala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbala Omosisi mafyiwu ma. Iyopo, Ukpo e so gedegede tee Ɔzhizɔsi akwu obwoshi uwu Ukpo uwɔkpɔɔ, a ka ebwoshi umba Ukpo umba luzɛ undekyi ma. Iyɔla, mu Ɔzhizɔsi gba umbwalu o sa wu ma mbaa ingbomo mbala iyi mbala lukwu le. Ɔzhizɔsi, mu kwunzu wu ungwu Oboshi uwakɔ, e shi isama iyi ongbulolo iyi bɔkɔ o koko yi mo mu isabo iwomo iyi azɔfyi iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu imbwalu Ukpo uwu Iburu. Mu umɛ uwakwu 11 uwu kwupu kwɔlɛ, onzu uwu a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ le a yaa ɛnyi iyi enzu umba ɔ zɛ luzɛ undu ikwidufulo mu Izirɛ akwɛyi a kpɛshɛku laa enzu umba o ka mba kwupu kwɔlɛ le tee lɔ zɛ luzɛ undu bɔkɔ mba ɔ zɔ tee ɔ zɛ. Mu umɛ uwakwu 12 uwu kwupu kwɔlɛ, a za laa wa wakwupwu kwɔlɛ te lo so wu mu luzɛ undu ikwidufulo nzhii ba imbwama iyi kwuye la eyi ibɔma mu Ɔzhizɔsi, lo yidu mu inyashi iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ i bi du mbo. Mu imbwama iyi kwupwu kwɔlɛ, a ta mba amasa a gba e tu mbo mo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Okrasi - Izɔma lɛɛbi iyi Ukpo (1.1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okrasi - a kaa alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo ma (1.4-2.18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okrasi - a kaa Omosisi mbala Ozhoshuwa ma (3.1-4.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okrasi - a kaa obwoshi uwunawuna ma (4.14-7.28)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iso ishimɛzhi iyi Okrasi i ka iyinayina ma (8.1-9.22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Isabo iyi Okrasi i ka iyinayina ma (9.23-10.39)</para>
  <para style="io1">Inzumbɛkwu iyi ikwidufulo (11.1-12.29)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shi Ukpo ɔnyɛ (13.1-19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ukpo ilɛma uwu imbwama (13.20-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iso imbwambwa (13.22-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Iso Iyi Ukpo I Ngyi Mbaa Umɛ Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Mekyi Ukpo e siso mbala asɔkwu nzu izhi guruguru mu ɛgwuzɛ riba riba mu lunzu undu anukenzu, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />inyete mu afyi iyi imbwama ɛlɛ ba Ukpo e siso mbala nzu mu Umɛ wu ŋa. Uwu gba Ukpo e wo ingyinangyina mbala wu le. Uwu gba Ukpo a ŋa kaa lakwu u ri ogu uwu kiya ingyinangyina le. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Uwu gba akwu ɛbɛ iyi inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo le. A ri kyakya mbala Ukpo, ekpasu iyi iso wu gba i ra la kwudu kwɔlɛ le lɛɛbi. Mizhikembo iyi umɛ wu a gba la ingbomo iyi enzu a kpamba akwɛyi a ŋɔma moshi mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu Ukpo Edego-ala.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inzumbɛku Iyi Umɛ Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Umɛ ele Ukpo e wo wu a ka alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo ma kyamate bɔkɔ ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi wu i ka iyamba ma awu. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Moo Ukpo a za laa ɔlɔgbulɔ wu ukpukpɛnyi tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Umɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ɔnɛnɛ mi kwu Ada ŋa dɛ-ɛ mo.&gt;&gt; Nana Ukpo e siso mu reshi ingyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwunawuna tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Imi mii kwu Ete wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">akwɛyi uwu ba aakwu umɛ mi&gt;&gt; dɛ-ɛ mo.<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />kwuyengwu Ukpo a gyi tee la lɔ Umɛ wu ɔnzɔnu uwu kwonze mu kwudu kwɔlɛ akwɛyi a zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo lɛɛbi o gbo wu ɔya mɛga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Mu reshi ingyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo ba Ukpo a zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">&lt;&lt;Ukpo e wo alɔgbulɔ wu kyamate ekpo tayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">ɛmɛgba wu ba kyamate ɔyi ububu tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.8,9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">Ps 45.6,7</char>
    </note> Mu reshi ingyi Umɛ ba, Ukpo a zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">&lt;&lt;Ɛsu ŋɔ, Edego-ala, ba akwiyi iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ongbulolo gba ŋɔ ri ɛsu ŋɔ le.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ŋɔ gyi ototo iyira ba ŋɔ gyi yi mo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Ɛlɛ gba i shi Ukpo, Ukpo ŋɔ, a ŋa ŋa akwɛyi e shi ŋɔ ɔnyɛ uwu inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ i kaa iyi e shi ɛmɛza ŋa ma bedebede le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />E kyo a zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ, Ɔkwu, mu iyemo uŋɔ gba ŋɔ wo ɛzhi le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">oshi ba akwu ɛduma iyi ewo ŋɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Apula ɛnyi lɛɛbi itomo memowu, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ yi iyɔkpɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Lɛɛbi yi ii wuma kyamate ekpayi tayi.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ŋɔɔ kwu yi mo kyamate origa tayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">akwɛyi o ŋanga yi ma kyamate ekpayi iyekyi tayi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ ŋangama mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">lɔri ŋɔ lu do te lu bomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">Ps 110.1</char>
    </note> Ukpo a da za laa ɔlɔgbulɔ wu ukpukpɛnyi tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">&lt;&lt;Ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi mi munɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">kaa la mi wo agewa ŋa lo kwu kagyi unga alɛ ifulomo ŋɔ dɛɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char>
      <char style="xdc" closed="false">Tb 12.14,15</char>
    </note> Inyete alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo ba akwu mbɛ? Umba akwu ɛndu iyi bɔkɔ ii wo ɛduma laa Ukpo akwɛyi a lɔ yi ma kaa li mbwama laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo fya isama awu.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Isama Iyɛkwuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, la ki rima ngiri mu apula iyi ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ ki pwa awu kaa la ki lafya la ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi bɔkɔ alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o zɛ laa asɔkwu nzu, o zɔ yi tee akwu ongbulolo, akwɛyi onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a mbwalu yi mo naa e loyi mo mo, aa na inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i fa te la na. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, i wo la ba ki ma inyashi mo gba ki shi egbo mu isama iyɛku ɛlɛ mo? Ɔkwu mafyiwu gba e to keyi mu anu itama iyi isama ɛlɛ le, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ ɔ pwa wu, ɔ zɔ nzu tee akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Kwuye kwɔngu tete Ukpo e kyo izɔgɔ wu mbala iyamba mu apula iyi amɛ mbala apula iyi izele iwomo mbala rɛshi ishimo ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mate bɔkɔ i she wu.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okrasi A Ka Nzu Laa Isama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Ukpo e shi alɔgbulɔ wu ɛsu iyi kwudu ungwepo ungwu kwu yi mu inyɔma ungwu ki siso ngwu ele mo. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Tetete, kyamate o ka mu riyi ingyifo mu Kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">&lt;&lt;Ukpo, onzu akwu mbɛ bɔkɔ ŋɔ bi egbo wu te;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">onzu uwu inyi igyi bi ba ŋɔ yese mbaa wu te?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Ŋɔ shi wu kwunzu ungwu kwu ba ungwu alɔgbulɔ ŋɔ mo kwuye bwɛɛ bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">ŋɔ shi wu inzumbɛku mbala igba,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />akwɛyi ŋɔ shi wu ɛsu iyi kiya ingyinangyina.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee &lt;&lt;Ukpo e shi wu ɛsu iyi kiya ingyinangyina&gt;&gt;; ɛlɛ ikyo kiya ingyinangyina. Kinzu ba ki ma wu te akwu ɔsu uwu kiya ingyinangyina kekelele mo. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Kinzu ba ki ma Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu o shi wu kwunzu ungwu kwu ba ungwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mo iyi kwuye bwɛɛ, kaa kwuwongu esheshi iyi Ukpo, le kpomo kwuwongu uwewe. Kekelele ki ma o shi wu inzumbɛku mbala igba kwuwongu lukwu undu bɔkɔ e kpo.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />I sheshi bɔkɔ Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e wo akwɛyi a ra la apula iyinayina le awu, tee le shi Ɔzhizɔsi la nyɔlɔma mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu inyashi imama, kaa le bo la enzu gyɔɔ kaa lo fya inzumbɛku wu. Moo akwu Ɔzhizɔsi gba a ka mba la isama le. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Uwu gba a wulu enzu ma sɛsɛsɛ mu ingbomo mbo le. Uwu, uwu bɔkɔ a wulu enzu ma sɛsɛsɛ mbala umba bɔkɔ o wulu mba ma sɛsɛsɛ awu, o yi Ada kyaa. Inyi gba i shi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo lovya iyi a ya mba tee ɛmanyi wu mo le. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />A za la Ukpo tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">&lt;&lt;Imi mi so ɛmɛnɛ mi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">mii du ŋɔ ma kwuyengwu ɛlikpalama mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />E kyo a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi wɛlɛ mu Ukpo.&gt;&gt; A gba a zɔ kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi ŋɔ le mbala ɛmɛ umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Kwuwongwu enzu umba Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mba ma le akwu umba ivye iyɛnwu mbala ɛnzhi, Ɔzhizɔsi mafyi wu a vindɔ onzu akwɛyi e yi kyamate umba tayi . E wo ɛlɛ te kaa Onzu uwoyi, uwu e yi ekpasu mu lukwu awu, la ngbɛwu ɛdɔ ma, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />akwɛyi mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ, a wa la umba bɔkɔ o yi kyamate enye tayi kwuwongu o wiyi iyi lukwu awu ma. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Moo i ta kwudu ndundu te akwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo gba aa mbwa mba ma le mo, akwu ɛdɔ iyi Aburamu gba aa mbwa mba ma le. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, akwu mɛga te le yi kyamate ɛmanyi wu mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna tayi, kaa la kwu Oboshi Uwakɔ mba uwu e yi eyembembyi mbala uwu bɔkɔ o fulo idu ma wu mu ɛduma wu iwomo la Ukpo kaa lo gba la ingbomo iyi enzu lo kpa mba. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Uwu e do te a mbwama la umba bɔkɔ ɔ pwa mba ma, kwuwongu uwu mafyiwu a ma inyashi tete kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o pwa wu ma awu.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Omosisi Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi wa mbwalu, lunyi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e kyo a ya yi ma tete awu! La lu bi egbo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔ wu kaa lakwu Oboshi Uwakɔ uwu i kwu idu fulo iyi ki so izɔgɔ yi awu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />E wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔ wu tee le wo, kyamate Omosisi e wo iyi bɔkɔ o za wu tee le wo mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo awu. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Onzu uwu e mbo kwogba a ka kwogba kwɔngu igba ma. Tatayi Ɔzhizɔsi i fa tee lo shi wu igba iyi bɔkɔ i ka iyi Omosisi ma. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Moo kwogba ungwunanguna, onzu gba e mbo le, Ukpo gba ba e mbo ingyinangyina le. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Omosisi e wo ɛduma iyi umɛgba marimari mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo, kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo e so wu te le wo awu akwɛyi e so apula iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e be so mu keyi. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Okrasi ba e wo ɛduma iyi Umɛ u bɔ kwuyi mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo marimari kyamate bɔkɔ o so wu te le wo awu. Gba ki ra la eyi ifulomo nzu gbagiri akwɛyi ki wiyi mo, de ba kinzu ki kwu enzu wu.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛnwugbomo Iyi Enzu Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kyamate Kwundu uwu Ukpo e so:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">Ɔnɛnɛ gba lu pwa opwu uwu Ukpo,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />la lu koko egbo yi mo mo kyamate bɔkɔ asɔkwu yi o wo kwuyengwu o towo Ukpo mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o pwa wu ma mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Ukpo a za mba tee mɔmɔ gba umbeteyi o pwa mi ma le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">kyo laa apula iyi mi wo leyi mbo mu lɔri uwekpendo. <verse eid="HEB 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi mi mi wo amba mbala mba le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">akwɛyi mi zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;O towo mi mo mu egbo mbo iyɔkpɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">akwɛyi o towo ɔkpa mi imbwaluma.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Amba o wo mi mo akwɛyi mi vungɔma tee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">&lt;O do te o fye mu riyi ingyi ɛnwugbomo mi gbee mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi wa mbwalu, la lu ngbɛndu kaa lo fya ukpɛnyi meka yi uwu ingbomo mbala i towo ikwu idu lu fulo wu i shi a lafya la Ukpo ureyi mo. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />La lu ka esu ɛnwu ma kwɔfyikwɔfyi. La lu wo ɛduma mu kapa unga lu fya &lt;&lt;Ɔnɛnɛ&gt;&gt; kaa ukpukpɛnyi yi la kɔ egbo ma mo akwɛyi e towo iso iyi Ukpo imbwaluma mo. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Moo kinzu ki kwu wa wo ɛduma kyaa mbala Okrasi gba ki ra la ikwu idu lu fulo iyi ki yi yi mu iyemo awu nzhii ba ibomo iyi kwuye.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Ɛlɛ gba kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so le tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">&lt;&lt;Ɔnɛnɛ, gba lu pwa opwu uwu Ukpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">la lu towo yi mo kyamate asɔkwu yi o wo awu mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">akwɛyi o towo Ukpo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Enzu umbana bɔkɔ o pwa opwu uwu Ukpo, ba o towo wu mo? Akwu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ Omosisi a wa mba ma mu Izhipiti le. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Umbana bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo amba mbala mba nzhii ba lɔri uwekpendo? Akwu umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo akwɛyi o fu mɛzhi o kpomo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Umbana bɔkɔ Ukpo a vungɔma tee, &lt;&lt;O do te o fye mu ɛzhi iyi ɛnwu igbomo mo&gt;&gt;? Akwu umba bɔkɔ o towo wu mo le. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ki ma yi gedegede tee o fɔma laa ifyemo mu ɛzhi ɛnyi kwuwongu o kwu idu lu fulo mo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Moo Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi te ki fye mu ɛnwu igbomo wu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ la ki ngbɛndu, kaa ɔnzɛnzɛnyi te la fɔma la ifyemo ma yi mo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Moo kinzu tete ki pwa anu itama iyi ɛza iyeshi kyamate umba tete e. O pwa ilɔ ɛnyi, ba o ri kwule yi mo, kwuwongu o pwa yi ba o na yi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo mo. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Kekelele kinzu umba ki kwu idu lu fulo le gba ki fye mu ɛnwu igbomo ɛnyi le, kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo e so tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;&lt;Mi wo amba akwɛyi mi vungɔma tee:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;O fye mu riyi ingyi ɛnwu igbomo mi gbee mo!&gt;&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">E so ɛlɛ le moo ɛduma wu lala a mbwa yi ma ngba mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Moo e siso iyi afyi erewo mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo mu riyi ingyi fo tee: &lt;&lt;Ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungworowo, ɛnwu i gbo Ukpo mo mu ɛduma wu lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Iso ɛlɛ o gba ya laa isomo tee: &lt;&lt;O fye mu riyi ingyi ɛnwu igbomo mi gbee mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa ɛza iyeshi ɛnyi keyi, o fyemo mu ɛnwu igbomo ɛnyi mo, kwuwongu o kwu idu lu fulo mo. Tetete umbafo o shi mbo te lo fye kaa ɛnwu li gbo mbo mo mbala Ukpo. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Kwuwo kwɔngu Ukpo e shi kwɔfi kwowa ungwu ifyemo mu ɛnwu igbomo wu. &lt;&lt;Ɔnɛ&gt;&gt; gba akwu kwɔfi kwɔngu le. Mizhikembo iyi lɔri gyɔɔ e siso ɛnyi mu kenzu unga Odevidi mu iso iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ o ka yi ma kpeke awu tee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">&lt;&lt; Ɔnɛ, akwiyi ŋɔ pwa opwu uwu Ukpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">ki towo ipwama mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Moo gba Ozhoshuwa e shi mbo ɛnwu igbomo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e siso yi e shi mɛzhi awu, Ukpo e be siso iyi kwɔfyi kwowa fo. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Tetete kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo kwu yɔmɔ laa enzu umba Ukpo kpɔ, kyamate bɔkɔ ɛnwu i gbo Ukpo ma mu kwɔfyi ungwu orowo awu.<verse eid="HEB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o fye mu ɛnwu igbomo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e siso yi e shi mɛzhi awu, ɛnwu ii gbo mbo mo mu ɛduma mba kyamate bɔkɔ ɛnwu i gbo Ukpo mo mu ɛduma wu tayi. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la ki wo ogbo nzu mo kpiri kaa la ki fyemo mu riyi ingyi ɛnwu igbomo ngyɛngyi, kaa onzu ukpukpɛnyi nzu la fɔma kaa le fye mu riyi ngyɛngyi mate umba tayi mo kwuwongu o kwu idu lu fulo mo.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Iso iyi Ukpo iyi la reyi, ba i yi mu ɛduma iwomo, i rimo i ka ukpandɛrɛ uwu e rimo mu ɛsu epepo yi mo, i kpolo nzhii ba mɛmi mba bɔkɔ kwunyɔ mbala kwundu i kpolo esu, laa esa laa ingyi. Iyi bɔkɔ onzu a ra yi mu egbo wu iso iyi Ukpo ii wa yi kwudu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />I yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ oo nvye ngyi mo la Ukpo mo; kiya ingyinangyina bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo ki ta ndunduu meyi wu. Uwu gba ki wa kiya ingyi ɛnwu nzu i wo lɛɛbi kii shi wu le mɛga.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Akwu Oboshi Uwakɔ Uwakwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la ki rala ikwu idu lu fulo nzu iyi bɔkɔ ki so awu gbagiri. Moo ki yi Oboshi Uwakɔ uwu ekpasu, uwu bɔkɔ a ya kadu a ka mu idu iyi Ukpo Ɔzhizɔsi umɛ uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Moo Oboshi Uwakɔ nzu akwu uwu bɔkɔ a ma eyembembyi nzu kwuwongu ifɔma nzu. Ki yi uwu bɔkɔ o pwa wu ma mu ɛgwuzɛ riba riba mate kinzu tete ba e ngbomo mo.<verse eid="HEB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Kwuwongu ɔlɛ laa ki turugba laa ukpa uwu Ukpo la egbo ikpɛnyi. Mɔmɔ gba kii na eyembembyi wu le, gba ki fya esheshi kaa li mbwa nzu ma kwuye ngwu ugɔ a kpa nzu ma le.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />O ŋa obwoshi uwakɔ uwunawuna meka iyi enzu wu ba o to wu kaa la kwu u bɔ kwuzu uwu enzu wu mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo i womo, kaa le wo isabɔ mbala rɛshi kwuwongu ingbomo mbo. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Mate uwu mafyi wu e kpɔfɔ mu ɛgwuzɛ riba riba awu, a zɛ bɛtɛ mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo ba o yitu te o ngbomo mo. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Akwu kwuwongu ikpɔfɔ wu gba a nya la kiya ingyi isabɔ ingya wu mbala ingyi enzu tete le. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />I yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to inzumbɛku ɛnyi la ɛnwu wu kaa la kwu obwoshi uwakɔ mo; Ukpo kɛɛkyi wu gba a ŋa wu le mate bɔkɔ a ŋa Ɛrɔnu awu. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Tatayi Okrasi e to inzumbɛku iyi obwoshi uwakɔ e fulo ɛnwu wu mo, Tetete, Ukpo a za wu te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Umɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">ɔnɛnɛ mi kwu Ada ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />A gba zɔ mu riyi ingyi fo tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔɔ kwu obwoshi uwɔkpɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">kyamate Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu a lɛ Ukpo la oga ilomo gbɔrɔrɔ la Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ a sa wu ma mu lukwu. Kwuwongwu uwu a gyi ɛnwu wu ma ba ewo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, Ukpo ba a pwa wu. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Uwu uwu bɔkɔ akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo lala, a ma inyashi dɛ gba a vɔngɔ ilomo le. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi wu a mbwa ɛduma wu ma, akwɛyi e shi wu akwu undu uwu isama la enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo wu mo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Akwɛyi Ukpo a ya wu te obwoshi uwakɔ mate Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ tayi.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyemalu Meka Iyi I Gba Kembo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Ki yi apula gyɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ ki gyi la ki so mu iso ɛlɛ, ba ikɔma ka la ki so yi yi, moo lu zɔngɔma kiya ma efya mo.<verse eid="HEB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ta kekelele te ishoshi te ka la lu kwu wazɔkiya ŋa, ɔbulɛ lu gyi te onzu la zɔ yi igwumo iyi iso iyi Ukpo kpɔ. Ifate kaa la lu ri ɔwɛ ŋa ba lu wo kwɔmɛ bɛnɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo kwɔmɛ akwu umɛ uwelu bɛnɛ, e yitu iyi ikikɔ iyeshi mbala iyira-a mo.<verse eid="HEB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ɔwɛ ba akwu kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kɔma-a, umba bɔkɔ mu ivɔngɔma mba kwɔfyi kwɔyi, o da iyeshi mbala iyira ma.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la ki shekeyi la ɛzɔ iyi bɔkɔ ikɔma mo iyi bɔkɔ o zɔ nzu mu igwumo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki na Okrasi awu kaa la ki sheyimo mu keyi mu ɛzɔ iyi ɛkɔ. La ki gbala ola uwu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ i renzu mu lukwu awu igwumo fo kaa la ki kwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />mbala ɛzɔ iyi obatisima mbala iso iyi ifulo onzu kwuwo; mbala iso iyi iyimo mu lukwu mbala ombu izɔma uwɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />La ki sheyimo mu keyi! Gba Ukpo a nyama ɛlɛ ki wo yi mo. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Moo enzu umba bɔkɔ o lafya la ikwu idu lu fulo mbo ba oo wo te bɔkɔ o gba mba o nyɔ mu itamɛzhi kpɔ? O yi mu ɛbɛ iyi Ukpo dɛɛ; o pwa rɛshi ngyi ri wɔ moshi kenzu ba o fya ogbo mbo uwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo; <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />o pwa esheshi iyi Ukpo ma ba o ma ekpasu iyi kwushi ungwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ba nyɔ awu. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Umba ba o lafya la ikwu idu lu fulo mbo! Iwomo kaa lo gba mba lo bo mbaa itamɛzhi fo, kwuwongu o gbala umɛ uwu Ukpo o kpa mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu ba o lo wu lovya gedegede.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ i wo embyi umba ukpo uwu e tumo e fu ma yi wɔrɔwɔrɔ akwɛyi i wala ewiri la umba bɔkɔ o gba yi.<verse eid="HEB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Gba ba ɛzhi ɛnyi i wala awula mbala ɔsɛ; i yi ɛduma fo; Ukpo a nda te ee fu yi lunzu fo ba a ngbɛ yi ɛdɔ ma mɔyi. <verse eid="HEB 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ta ki siso ɛlɛ le, ɛmɛza mi umba idɛnyi, egbo nzu akwu ikpɛnyi munyi yi. Ki yitu tee lu yi ɔnyɛ uwu a ka le, inyi gba i bo la isama yi le. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Ukpo akwu onzu uwura mo. A kalakwuleyi laa ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ lu wo naa idɛnyi iyi lu zɔ kwuwo wu akwɛyi lu mbwama la wambalu ba lu degbo mu iwomo awu mo. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Ki gyi tee uwewe yi la gyakpɔ nzhii ba li so mu imbwama, kaa apula iyi bɔkɔ ki sheyi yi awu la ki fya yi ma ngboro. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ki gyi te la lu kpɔfɔ mo, ba la lu yi kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu idu lu fulo ba o yidu, akwɛyi o na kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so mbo e shi mɛzhi awu.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso ishi mɛzhi Iyi Ukpo Akwu Ngboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e siso e shi mɛzhi la Aburamu awu, a vungɔma te uwu e wo iyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi awu. Mate bɔkɔ i yi onzu wu bɔkɔ a ka wu ma mo awu, a vungɔma e to la ɛnyi wu.<verse eid="HEB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />A zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi vungɔma mii shi ŋɔ esheshi ba mii wo kaa ɛdɔ ŋɔ li yi riba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Aburamu e yidu akwɛyi a na iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi awu. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ki vungɔma, ki to la ɛnyi iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka nzu ma, akwɛyi ivungɔma ɛnyi i shi kambu ka bɔma. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Ukpo a gyi tee umba bɔkɔ uwu e siso e she mbo mɛzhi awu, lo yitu sɛsɛ tee, iyi bɔkɔ uwu e so awu a ŋanga egbo wu ma mo; akwɛyi e kyo a vungɔma. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Apula ikpepo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi awu, i ŋangama mo, Ukpo a mwangba mo. Kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki fya isama munyi wu awu la ki ra la eyi ifulomo nzu gbagiri. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Eyi ifulomo nzu ɛlɛ i yi kyamate utumutu tayi uwu egbo nzu, bɔkɔ ii shi ki yi egbo epo mo ba ki wiyi mo. Inyi gba i shi nzu ki ngbɛ yaa mu eregye iyi ɔtɛpu uwoshi kaa la ki fye mɛmi mu idu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Ɔzhizɔsi e to keyi e fyemo mɔmɔ kwuwo nzu oo. Akwu obwoshi uwakɔ nzu iyɔkpɔɔ, kyamate Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ tayi.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Oboshi Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ ele akwu ɔsu uwu Ɔsalɛmu, a gba akwu obwoshi uwu Ukpo uwakwu. Tabɔkɔ Aburamu e yi mu igbama mbaa ewa kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a ngbɛ asu wendo mo awu, akwɛyi Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ e kpolo wu akwɛyi a ta wu kenzu ungeshi, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />akwɛyi Aburamu e to kiya kikpɛnyi meka iyi uwo iyi apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ a fya mu ewa akwɛyi e shi wu. (Iluma iyi kwonze iyi ɛnyi iyi Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ gba akwu &lt;&lt;Ɔsu uwu ototo&gt;&gt;; akwɛyi kwuwongu bɔkɔ akwu Ɔsu uwu Ɔsalɛmu, iluma yi gba akwu &lt;&lt;Ɔsu uwu oloto.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ ele e yi ada mo ba e yi ɛnɛ mo ba o yi ɛdɔ wu mo. E yi iyemo mo ba e yi imbwama mo. E yi mate Umɛ uwu Ukpo tayi; akwu obwoshi uwu Ukpo iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Kekelele lu ma onzu ele akwu onzu uwakwu. Moo Aburamu usɔkwu nzu lala e shi wu ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ akwu mbaa ewa awu. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i shi ɛmɛ umba Olevi ebwoshi tee lo na ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo mbaa enzu umba Izirɛ, mbaa ɛmanyi mba, umba bɔkɔ o kwu ɛmɛ umba Aburamu tete awu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ uwu bɔkɔ akwu oye uwu Olevi mo lala, a na ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo mbaa Aburamu akwɛyi a ta wu kenzu ungeshi, Aburamu uwu bɔkɔ a na iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kaambu ke yi mu ɛlɛ mo tee onzu u ta kenzu ungeshi a ka uwu bɔkɔ o ta wu awu ma. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Mu iso ɛlɛ iyi ebwoshi umba Olevi, enzu umba o kpomo gba o na ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi egbo uwo le; mu iso iyi Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ ba, onzu ureyi gba a na ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo le, mate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so tayi. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Akwɛyi ki do te kii zɔ tee, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Aburamu e shi ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo awu, Olevi uwu bɔkɔ ɛmɛ wu o na ogbo ukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo awu, e kyo e shi uwawu tete. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ e du Aburamu awu, Olevi o do mba wa mo, e degbo mu ɛnwu iyi usɔkwu wu Aburamu bɛnɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Akwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyi ebwoshi iwomo iyi ɛdɔ iyi Olevi gba ɛmɛ umba Izirɛlu o shi mbo ɛrama le. Gba ɛduma iyi ebwoshi iwomo iyi ɛdɔ iyi Olevi li nyɔlɔma, obwoshi uwufo le be bo fo, uwu bɔkɔ ebwoshi iwomo wu i yi kyamate iyi Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ, moo akwu mate iyi Ɛrɔnu mo. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Moo akwiyi gba o ŋanga ɛgwuzɛ iyi ebwoshi itomo mo, mɛga ɛrama o ŋanga yi ma tete. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Ɔkwu nzu uwu bɔkɔ o siso ɛlɛ le mu reshi wu a wɔ mu kenzu kɛlɛ mo, onzu uwu kenzu wu lala e de wo ɛduma iyi ebwoshi dɛ mo. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Moo ki yitu marimari tee Ɔkwu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Ozhuda; Omosis ba a zɔ tee ebwoshi ɔɔ wɔ mu kenzu kɛlɛ mo.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oboshi Uwufo E Yi Mate Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ Tayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Iso ɛlɛ i yi pepe-e tee; obwoshi uwufo a wɔ, e yi mate Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ tayi. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ebwoshi iyi onzu ele, i ngyi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ onzu e wo mo, akwu mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ekpasu iyi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Moo kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔɔ kwu obwoshi iyɔkpɔɔ, ebwoshi ŋɔ i yi mate iyi Ɔmɛkizɛdɛ tayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɛrama iyekyi o pya yi ma o shi yi mɛzhi, kwuwongu i kɔma mo ba akwiyi umbwa byi. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Moo ɛrama iyi Omosisi i shi kiya ingyinangyina ki gyirima yɛriri mo. Kekelele eyi ifulomo i yi marimari-e, mu ɛlɛ gba ki yi kɛlɛɛ mbala Ukpo le. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Ivungɔma iyi Ukpo i kyo kadu tete. Ivungɔma iyi Ukpo i yi mo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ umbafo mbamba o to mbo ebwoshi. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba akwu obwoshi, kwuye ungwu Ukpo a vungɔma tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu a vungɔma a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">ba a gba kembo fo. A zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;Ŋɔ kwu obwoshi iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Kwuwongwu ivungɔma ɛlɛ, gba i shi Ɔzhizɔsi akwu onzu uwu kwudeka iyi iso i shi mɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ ishoshi i ka le le.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ikama iyifo i yi tee: ebwoshi umbafo gyɔɔ o yi tete, kwuwongu bɔkɔ o kpomo akwɛyi ɛduma mba i ka keyi fo. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi iyawu iyɔkpɔɔ; ɛduma iyi ebwoshi wu ba akwu iyɔkpɔɔ, ɛduma wu ba o shi yi onzawa fo. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, e do enzu isama iyɔkpɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mawu o bo mbaa Ukpo, kwuwongu e yi iyɔkpɔɔ mbaa Ukpo mu kwoya indama kwuwo mbo.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu obwoshi uwakɔ uwu bɔkɔ e do ugɔ nzu isama le. E yi kɛrikɛri; e yi kiya ingyi o yi wu ombu mangyi mo naa ingbomo mo; Ukpo a ka wu ma mbala enzu umba ingbomo akwɛyi Ukpo e yi wu mo a kawa moshi. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />E yi mate ebwoshi umbakɔ umbafo mbamba mo; e yi ugɔ uwu ee shi isabɔ iyi ɛnwu kwɔfyi kwɔfyi keyi dɛ ishi iyi enzu mo. Kwuye ungwu a ra lɛnwu e shi awu, e wo isabɔ izhɛnyi la enzu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i ŋa enzu umba bɔkɔ o nyɔlɔma mo tee lo kwu ebwoshi umbakɔ; ivungɔma iyi Ukpo, iyi bɔkɔ i bo kembo iyi ɛrama ba, i ŋa Umɛ, uwu bɔkɔ a nyɔlɔma mu kiya ingyinangyina iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Akwu Oboshi Nzu Uwakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Iso lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu isomo gba akwu tee ki yi Oboshi Uwakɔ, uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu ukpa uwɛsu uwu Ukpo moshi. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Ee wo ɛduma iyi Oboshi uwakɔ mu riyi ingyi ki ka kɛrikɛri le, mu kwunu shɛ ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu gba a la le, moo akwu onzu gba a la le mo.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Oboshi uwakɔ uwunawuna o ŋa wu kaa le shi rɛshi mbala isabɔ iyi izɔfyi la Ukpo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ akwu mega te Oboshi uwakɔ nzu le yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ee shi tete. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Gba le degbo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, la ba kwu obwoshi mo ndii, kwuwongu ebwoshi o yi mbaa bɔkɔ oo wo rɛshi mate bɔkɔ ɛrama iyi Azhu i zɔ te lo wo awu. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo akwu u wɔ mbala kwundu ungwu apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi moshi tayi. I yi mate bɔkɔ Ukpo e so Omosisi tayi. Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a gyi te le mbo Kwunu ungwu Ukpo awu, Ukpo a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Wo ekpasu ŋɔ kaa wo ingyinangyina ka mbwalu iyi bɔkɔ mi zɔ ŋɔ mu lɔwa awu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Kekelele ba, Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛduma iyi ebwoshi iyi bɔkɔ i ka iya mba ma, mate bɔkɔ kenzu igyirima unga bɔkɔ e wo mɔgɔ uwu Ukpo mbala enzu awu ka shiri le, kwuwongu o bɔ nga mu iso i shi mɛzhi iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ ishi ka le. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Moo gba kenzu igyirima unga ekyi la ke yi ɔnyɛnyɛ byi, ba la ki byi yi ugɔ uwu unga epo kɛlɛ fo. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ukpo ba a ma ikpa mɛzhi mba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a zɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu a zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">afyi i yi mu inyɔma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">iyi bɔkɔ mii gyiri kenzu ma unga epo mbala enzu umba Izirɛ ikyo mbala enzu umba Ozhuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Kenzu igyirima kɛlɛ ka ŋe yi mate unga bɔkɔ mi wo mbala umba asɔkwu mba awu mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi wa mba ma mu ɛzhi iyi Izhipiti awu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Kwuwongwu o mbwalu kenzu igyirima unga bɔkɔ Mi wo mbala mba kyoriri mo awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">akwɛyi Imi ba mi shi kwɔlu mbaa mba fo. <verse eid="HEB 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Ɔkwu a zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">afyi iyi i byi nyɔ awu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">kɛlɛ gba akwu kenzu igyirima unga mii wo mbala enzu umba Izurɛ le tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Imi mii shi ɛrama mi mu egbo mbo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">akwɛyi mi ka yi ma mu akɔ mba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Imi mii kwu Ukpo mbo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">umba ba ɔɔ kwu enzu mi.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Akwu mega tee onzu a zɔ onzu uwu kwuse wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">naa umanyi wu tee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">&lt;Yitu iyi Ɔkwu&gt; fo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Moo enzu lɛɛbi o yitu mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ina mu ɛmɛshɛri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">nzhii ba mu enzu umbakɔ.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Moo Imi mii gba la ingbomo mbo mii kpamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">mi gba mi lolo ingbomo mbo fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Tabɔkɔ e siso meka iyi kenzu igyirima ungepo, Ukpo e shi unga kwonze kanga akwu ungekyi; akwɛyi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyekyi ba ki sɛma akwɛyi kii tomo.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Oya Igbomo Uwɛzhi Mbala Uwoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ o so o shi mɛzhi iyi kwonze awu i yi ɛrama yi iyi oya igbomo mbala riyi ingyi oya igbomo tete. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />O bɔ kwunu, kwudu ungwu kunu ngwɔlɛ o ya ngwu te kizɛ kɛ kɛrikɛri. Mɛmi iyi ugu awu kambyɔyi mbala eteburu mbala koburedi ungwu oo wo rɛshi la Ukpo i yi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Mu izhikembo iyi eregye iyopo enyi ugu uwufo e yi mɔmɔ uwu o ya te Kizɛ Ki Ka Kɛrikɛri le. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Kizɛ ngyɛlɛ ki yi kwumbu ungwu isabɔ ungwu egolu ungwu o pwu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere mbala Kwokpati ungwu iso i shi mɛzhi ungwu bɔkɔ o kpa ngwu embyi umba egolu lɛɛbi mɛnwu, kwu yi ogya uwu egolu akwɛyi omana e yi mɛmi ngwu, mbala upi uwu Ɛrɔnu uwu bɔkɔ e tumo a wa la epu awu, mbala ekyi epo iyi bɔkɔ o ka ɛrama iyi Omosisi ma yi awu. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Ashɛrɔbi umba bɔkɔ akwu inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo le o yi mu kadu unga Kokpakyi kwɔngu, ekowo mbo ba i koko riyi ingyi bɔkɔ oo gba la ingbomo oo kpa awu. Kekelele ba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki so iso ɛlɛ ma marimari kwu yi mo.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Kwuye ungwu o mbwa iyinayina inɔngɔma ma, akwɛyi ebwoshi o koko o fyemo mɛmi iyi kunu ungwu kwudu kaa lo wo ɛduma mba, <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />ba Oboshi Uwakɔ awu kɛɛkyi gba e fyemo mu Kunu ungwɛmi kwɔngu le, ba e fyemo mangwu izhɛnyi kari. Aa za la ɛnzhi umba isabɔ iwomo lɛwu mbala umba ingbomo iyi enzu lɛɛbi, ikyo ingbomo iyi enzu o wo ba akwu mu iyitu mbo mo. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Mu iwomo ɛlɛ te, Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mu enzu izɔma gedegede tee ɔgwuzɛ uwu o fye mu Riyi Ingyi Ri Ka Kɛrikɛri le o do wu wu ma mo mate bɔkɔ Kwunu ungwu kwudu kwu degbo bɛnɛ le. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Apula ɛnyi kpɛkpɛyi akwu mate kwuwo izɔma mu iyi kwuyengwu kekelele. I zɔ tee rɛshi mbala isabɔ iyi izɔfyi iyi bɔkɔ eboshi o wo awu i do tee i gbɔ egbo iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ oo gbo oya ma sɛsɛ mo, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />moo ɛrama ɛnyi akwu meka iyi kiya irimo mbala embyi iwomo byi mbala ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi bɔkɔ enzu o wulu ɛmba ma. Ɛrama ɛnyi akwu kwuwongu apula iyi kwudu byi ba i yɔmɔ i rigbo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ba nyɔ laa apula iyepo.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Okrasi ba e bo-o kaa la kwu Oboshi uwakɔ meka iyi apula iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ i yi ee awu. Kwunu ungwu bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma kwu ka inzumbɛku le, kwu gba kwu shiri le; kwunu kwɔlɛ o mbo mu ewo iyi onzu mo, iyi bɔkɔ mi so gba i yi tee, kwu kyo mbala kwudu kwɔlɛ ungwu o ndo kwondo ngwu ele mo. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a zɛ mu kwunu akwɛyi e fye mu Riyi Ingyi Ri Ka Kɛrikɛri le awu, e fye izhɛnyi bi ba iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ, e wo ɛduma mu ɛnzhi umba ɛmu mbala endo kaa le wo isabɔ mo; uwu ba e wo ɛduma mu ɛnzhi wu akwɛyi e shi nzu isama iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Ɛnzhii umba ɛmu mbala umba endo anu mba mbala kwulɔ ungwu umɛ uwu endo akwɛyi obwoshi ee kpo ngwu mu ɛnwu iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o wuluma mo kaa lo wulu mba ma mu apula iyi bɔkɔ i shi mbo o wuluma mo awu. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ te gba i yi le awu, i zɔ te ɛnzhi umba Okrasi o ka ekpasu laa umba ɛmu mbala endo mo! Mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo, Okrasi e shi ɛnwu laa Ukpo kaa lakwu isabɔ iyi i ka le. Ɛnzhii wu o gbɔ egbo nzu mo mu apula iyi umbwa kaa la ki gbo Ukpo uwɔkpɔɔ ɔya.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Okrasi gba a nɔngɔ kenzu igyirima unga epo le, kaa enzu umba Ukpo a ya mba ma oo fya esheshi iyɔkpɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ e wo mbo. Moo Okrasi e kpomo kaa la wa mba ma mu rinye igbomo ingyi ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo kwuyengwu kenzu igyirima iyi kwonze i yi awu.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Mɛka iyi iso iyi ogu uwu apula iyi ukpɛzhi, akwu mega tee onzu uwu e so yi awu e kpomo dɛ, <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />moo iso ɛnyi iyi ekpasu mo akwiyi gba onzu uwu e so yi e degbo la kwunyɔ bɛnɛ; iso ɛnyi iyi ekpasu mu izhikembo iyi lukwu undu onzu awu. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba kenzu igyirima unga kwonze kanga lala ke yi ekpasu mu ɛnzhi kɛɛkyi le.<verse eid="HEB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Iyi kwonze, Omosisi a wa ɛrama ma la enzu lɛɛbi mate bɔkɔ a ka yi ma awu. Akwɛyi e to ɛnzhi umba ɔgbɛbɛ uwu endo ɔnumba mbala ɛmu, akwɛyi a vyi mba ma mbala embyi, akwɛyi a fya mba mu kwokpo ungwu ɛrama akwɛyi a vyɛ enzu ma lɛɛbi, ee wo ɛduma mu epu iyi bɔkɔ o ya yi te isopu mbala inyi ifyobyo iyi ilɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Omosisi a za la enzu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛnzhii mbɔlɛ gba o ma nzu ma mbala kenzu igyirima unga bɔkɔ Ukpo a zɔ te la lu mbwalu le awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Tatayi gba Omosisi tete a fya ɛnzhi mu Kunu ungwu Ukpo mbala apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma ma yi kwuyengwu ɔya igbomo le. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Tayi gba i yi le, ɛrama iyi Omosisi i zɔ te kiya ingyinangyina o wulu ngyi ma mu ɛnzhi, gba o fu ɛnzhi ma mo Ukpo a gbala ingbomo a kpa mo.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isabɔ Iyi Okrasi I To Ingbomo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Apula ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ akwu u wɔ uwu apula iyoshi ireyi awu, akwu mega te lo wulu yi ma mu ɛnzhi umba izɔfyi. Apula iyoshi ɛnyi mafyi yi ba isabɔ yi i koshi la ɛlɛ gba i gyi le. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Moo Okrasi e fye mu Kizɛ kɛ Kɛrikɛri ingyi bɔkɔ enzu o mbo le mo, kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ ki kwu u wɔ uwu kizɛ kireyi. Ɔzhizɔsi e fye moshi shɛ, mbaa bɔkɔ kekelele a ri midu iyi Ukpo kwuwo nzu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Obwoshi uwu Ukpo uwakɔ uwu Azhu e fye mu Riyi Ingyi Ri Ka Kɛrikɛri le kari kari la ɛnzhi umba izɔfyi. Okrasi ba e fye mɔmɔ kaa la ra la ɛwu le shi izhi riba riba mo, <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />moo lakwu tayi de ba Okrasi la ba ma inyashi izhi riba riba ngbaa te bɔkɔ o wo kwudu kwɔlɛ awu. Okrasi kekelele ba, a wɔ izhɛnyi kɛɛkyi mu imbwama iyi ɔyi lɛɛbi kaa le to ingbomo mo mu isabɔ iyi ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ e shi. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Onzu uwunawuna e kpomo izhɛnyi, mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi akwɛyi Ukpo ee fu wu ombu. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Tatayi Okrasi tete a ra lɛnwu wu e wo isabɔ izhɛnyi kaa le to ingbomo iyi enzu gyɔɔ ma le. Aa gba a nyɔ ungwopo, akwu tee kaa le to ingbomo ma mo, ba a nyɔ kaa la sa enzu umba bɔkɔ o rigbo wu awu ma.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Ɛrama iyi Omosisi akwu u wɔ uwu apula iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu inyɔma; moo akwu ireyi mafyi yi mo. Inyi i domo tee ii shi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e bo mbaa Ukpo laa nyɔlɔma yɛriri kwuwongu isabɔ iyi bɔkɔ e koko ee wo awu mo. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Lɔ zɔ tee enzu umba o gbo Ɔya laa Ukpo o yi sɛsɛ, gba isabɔ ɛnyi li gbɔ ingbomo ma ireyi, isabɔ iwomo li bi yi fo, akwɛyi ba lo bo ma tee umba o yi ingbomo mo. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Isabɔ iwomo ɛnyi ba o wo yi kari kari, kaa li shi enzu lo lolo ingbomo mbo. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Moo ɛnzhi umba endo anu mba mbala ɛmu o do tee o gbɔ ingbomo ma mo.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ŋa nyɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, a za laa Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">&lt;&lt;Isabɔ mbala rɛshi ŋɔ gyi yi mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">uŋɔ ba ŋɔ shi mi ɛnwu ka la mi shi.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Uŋɔ ŋɔ mwɔnyɛ iyi isabɔ iyi ɛmu umba o pwu mbo mo ngyɔɔ mu ɔla uwu isabo mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">naa isabɔ iyi o wo yi kaa li gbɔ ingbomo ma mo.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Akwɛyi mi zɔ tee, &lt;Ukpo Imi mi ŋɔ le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kaa la mi wo iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">mate bɔkɔ o ka mu meka mi mu Kwokpo ungwu ɛrama iyi Omosis.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Iyi kwonze Okrasi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔɔ mwɔnyɛ mbala isabɔ mbala rɛshi iwomo mbala izɔfyi umba bɔkɔ o pwu mbo mo ngyɔɔ mu ɔla uwu isabɔ kaa li to ingbomo mo.&gt;&gt; E so tayi le bi mo e yitu tee isabɔ ɛlɛ lɛɛbi o wo yi mate bɔkɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi i so tayi. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo Imi mi ŋɔ le, mi bo tee la mi wo iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ukpo a pya isabɔ iyekyi ɛnyi ma akwɛyi isabɔ iyi Okrasi i ri kwunzu yi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kwuwongwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, kinzu lɛɛbi o wulu nzu ma mu ingbomo nzu kwuwongu rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ a ra la ɛnwu wu e shi izhi ikpɛnyi kɛɛkyi ba akwu iyɔkpɔ biŋa awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:10">
    <char style="bd">(????Kwuwongwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, kinzu lɛɛbi o wulu nzu ma mu ingbomo nzu kwuwongu rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ a ra la ɛwu e shi izhi ikpɛnyi kɛɛkyi ba akwu iyɔkpɔ biŋa awu.)</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:10">
    <char style="bd">(???Kwuwongwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, kinzu lɛɛbi o wulu nzu ma mu ingbomo nzu kwuwongu rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ a ra la ɛwu e shi izhenyi kɛɛkyi ba akwu iyɔkpɔ biŋa awu.)</char><verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi Obwoshi uwu Azhu uwunawuna ee wo ɛduma wu ba ee wo nzhii bi; isabɔ ɛlɛ ba i do ingbomo igbɔma mo ndii. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Okrasi ba a ra la ɛnwu wu e shi Ukpo isabɔ ikpɛnyi iyi ingbomo, isabɔ iyi bɔkɔ i yi ekpasu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ, akwɛyi a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu Ukpo. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Ee yi mɔmɔ nzhii ba kwuyengwu Ukpo e shi agewa wu o kwu kagyi unga alɛ ifulomo wu. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Kwuwongwu isabɔ ikpɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ e wo le, enzu umba bɔkɔ o gbɔ ingbomo mba ma e shi mbo o nyɔlɔma yɛriri.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to izɔgɔ meka iyi Okrasi tete. Iyi kwonze a zɔ tee:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu a zɔ tee, mu afyi iyi i bi nyɔ awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">kɛlɛ gba akwu kenzu igyirima unga mii wo mbala mba le tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Imi mii shi ɛrama mi mi mu akɔ mba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">akwɛyi mi ka yi ma mu egbo mbo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mii lolo ingbomo mbala ɛduma iyira mba fo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba ingbomo mbo o gba yi kpamba, rɛshi ingyi ki gbɔ ingbomo ma o yi ugɔ ngyi fo.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">La Ki Bo Kɛlɛ Mbaa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kwuwongu lukwu undu Okrasi, kinzu ki fyemo mu Riyi Ingyi Ri Ka Kɛrikɛri le mu egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Kwuwongwu lukwu wu, Okrasi a wu nzu ɔgwuzɛ uwepo ma, ɔgwuzɛ uwu kwunyɔ, uwu bɔkɔ u zɛ mu iregye, inyi gba akwu, ɛnwu wu le. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Kinzu ki yi Obwoshi uwakwu uwu bɔkɔ akwu u bɔ eyi mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la ki bo kɛlɛ mbaa Ukpo mu egbo ikpɛnyi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo iyi bɔkɔ i yi aka mo, mbala akɔ iyi bɔkɔ o wulu yi ma mu egbo iyira mbala ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ o gbɔ yi ma mu embyi wasɛsɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Kinzu la ki ra la eyi ifulomo nzu gbagiri, kwuwongu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e siso e shi mɛzhi awu ee wo yi tayi. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Kinzu la ki ka esu ɛnwu ma, la ki mbwama lesu, la ki gyesu akwɛyi la ki wo iyeshi lesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Kinzu la ki lafyima la igyirima mbala esu mo, mate bɔkɔ umbafo o koko oo wo tayi. Kinzu ba, la ki gyakpɔɔ mu esu ɛnwu ikɔma iyɔkpɔɔ, mate bɔkɔ lu yi mu imama tee kwɔfyi ungwu Ɔkwu kwu ndama fo awu.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Moo isabɔ iyi i gbɔ ingbomo nzu mo i yi fo akwiyi gba ki so wu mu ingbomo iyi iyayigbɛ mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ ki yitu iyi ongbulolo o. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Iyi bɔkɔ i shi gba akwu tee la ki rigbo ombu izɔma mbala ɔyi uwɔku uwu bɔkɔ u bu pwu agewa umba Ukpo mo! <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e lomo laa Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo, o ngbɛ wu ma, oo ma inyashi wu mo, akwiyi gba enzu wepo naa wala gba o to izɔgɔ tee e wo kiya ngyɛngyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o zhi Umɛ uwu Ukpo mo ba iyamba ii yi te? Umba bɔkɔ o zhi ɛnzhi umba kenzu igyirima umba bɔkɔ o wulu ingbomo mba ma? Umba bɔkɔ o pye Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu a ka la enzu esheshi ari? Mu imama yi, la lu byi egbo iyi inyashi iyina bɔkɔ i fate li du mbo mo! <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Moo kinzu ki yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mii wakwusa ma, mii wa ngwu mba ma&gt;&gt;; A gba e so kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu aa zɔ enzu wu ombu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Akwu kiya ingyi iyi kaa onzu le fye mu ɔwu uwu Ukpo ureyi!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />La lu lolo ewo iyi bɔkɔ i yi mekyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu pwa iso iyi Okrasi awu. Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ ɛbɛ iyi Ukpo i du yi, lu ma inyashi mu apula riba riba, inyashi ɛnyi ba i ri yi mo mo. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Lunyi umbafo o kpa yi ari gedegede, o lo yi inyashi mu eyi iyi enzu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o ye mbo mu iyi ilomo tete lala lu kyo mbala mba. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ugu ugyi lu ma inyashi mbala mba tete, lu mwɔnyɛ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o na yi apula ma kwuwongu lu yitu tee lu yi apula iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ma, iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ egbo yi li muma mo, kwuwongu ɛlɛ ii ka yi laa rigbɛ ingyɛkwuu. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Ishoshi tee la lu yidu, kaa la lu wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi akwɛyi luu fya iyi bɔkɔ e to yi ishi ma yi awu. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Moo mate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">&lt;&lt;Kwuye bwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">akwɛyi uwu, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu inyɔma awu, a nyɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">aa ngbɛ kwuye mo.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Enzu umba mi umba ototo ba oo yi kwunyɔ akwiyi gba o kwu idu lu fulo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">akwiyi gba ba onzu uwufo a gba kembo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Imi mi mwɔnyɛ mbala wu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Kinzu ba ki kwu enzu umba oo gba kembo akwɛyi o kpɛdɔma mo. Kinzu ki yi ikwu idu lu fulo akwɛyi ki fya isama ma.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Iluma Iyi Ikwidufulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />I yi ikwu idu lu fulo akwu inyama laa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ onzu e fulo eyi mangyi mbala egbo ifulomo mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki ma ngyi mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo ɛlɛ gba enzu umbekyi Ukpo a pwɔ mba ma le.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Akwu mu Ikwidufulo gba ki zɔngɔma ma tee Ukpo a rala iso wu gba e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le, moo apula iyi bɔkɔ ki ma yi ele e wo mu apula iyi bɔkɔ o ma yi meyi mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo gba Ɛbɛlu e wo isabɔ ireyi laa Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i ka iyi Okenu ma le. Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo wu gba Ukpo a nya wu ma tee akwu onzu ototo le, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e siso iyesheshi mu rɛshi wu. Kwuwongwu ikwu idu lu fulo wu, Ɛbɛlu e kpomo-o, tetete e degbo mu iso isomo. <verse eid="HEB 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo gba Ɛnɔki o towu mo lareyi, kaa la ma lukwu mo le. O ma wu mo kwuwongu Ukpo e to wu mo a ka wa moshi. Iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee Ɛnɔki e wo kiya ingyi ki she la Ukpo keyi dɛ gba Ukpo e to wu mo a kawa moshi le. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Iwomo kaa onzu le she laa Ukpo mo gba e ikwu idu fulo mo, moo onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyɔ mbaa Ukpo akwu mega kaa le yi ikwu idu fulo tee Ukpo e yi ba e shi rigbɛ laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o kagyi wu laa egbo mbo lɛɛbi.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Onowa a pwa iso mekeka iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki di wo dɛ mo. A pwa iso iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ a da ma yi de mo.E lomo laa Ukpo akwɛyi e wo kwoda ungwebyi ungwoku kaa la sa enzu umba kwɔgba wu ma le. Mu iwomo ɛlɛ, kwudu kwɔngu o ngbɛ ngwu ɛdɔ ma akwɛyi Ukpo e wo Onowa onzu ototo kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Aburamu e lomo laa Ukpo kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya wu ma tee kaa le so mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyiri kenzu mo te e shi wu awu. A lafya la kwuse wu ba e yitu mɔgɔ uwu bɔkɔ e sheyimo mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba a ŋɔ kyamate ugboga mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyiri kenzu mo te e shi wu awu. A ŋɔ mu ɛnu kyamate bɔkɔ Aziki mbala Ɔzhɛkɔpu, umba bɔkɔ o na kenzu igyirima ka kpɛnyi mbaa Ukpo. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Moo Aburamu a rigbo kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a nɔngɔ a gba e mbo, kwuse ungwu kwu yi ola uwɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Aburamu uwu bɔkɔ a wuma gyɔ-ɔ akwu ada le, Oko wu Osera ba akwu odogyi. Aburamu e kwu idu e fulo tee Ukpo ee wo kyamate bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi awu. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Aburamu a wuma e yi kyamate ukpɛzhi tayi, tetete, i zɛ ma wu gba enzu riba riba umba bɔkɔ o yi kyamate elovyo iyoshi mbala ɔgyɛ uwu risu uwu bɔkɔ o do wu iwama mo awu.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi o rala ikwu idu lu fulo mbo nzhii ba o kpomo. Umba ba o na apula iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi awu mo, umba ba o ri sharu o ma yi akwɛyi o na yi ma, o nya ma gedegede tee umba o kwu agboga mbala aganangba mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o so iso ɛlɛ te awu i zɔ te umba o yi mu ɛzhi iyamba ikagyima. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />O ka amasa iyi ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ o lunyi afyima awu mo, moo gba lo ka amasa, o bo gagyi kapa unga oo gbama. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Umba ba, o yi mu ɛzhi iyi i sheshi i ka le ikagyima, ɛzhi iyi i yi moshi. Ɛlɛ gba i shi Ukpo ba e wo lovya tee umba o ya wu tee Ukpo mbo mo le, kwuwongu a nɔngɔ kwuse e shi mbo-o.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Aburamu e to umɛ wu Aziki kaa le wo wu isabɔ kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a pwa wu ma awu le. Aburamu gba ba akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyiri kenzu mo mbala wu le, tetete e yi ɛnwu ma i yi bɔkɔ e shi umɛ wu ukpɛnyi awu kaa lo wo wu isabɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Ukpo ba e so wu-o tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu mu Aziki gba ŋɔ yi ɛdɔ iyi bɔkɔ mi gyiri kenzu mo mbala ŋa awu le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Aburamu e kwu idu fulo tee Ukpo e do te e yi Aziki ma mu lukwu, Aburamu ba a na Aziki ma mu lukwu kego.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Aziki e so e shi mɛzhi te a ta Ɔzhɛkɔpu mbala Isɔ kenzu unga esheshi le.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Ɔzhɛkɔpu a ta ɛmɛ umba Ɔzhɔsɛfu kenzu ungeshi dɛ gba e kpomo le. A wɛlɛ mu upi wu akwɛyi e gbo Ukpo ɔya.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Ɔzhɔsɛfu, e siso iyi iwɔma iyi Izirɛ mu Izhipiti, kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a nda la ikpomo fo akwɛyi e so mbo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o bo wo mu ekwu wu.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba ete uwu Omosisi mbala anyi wu o nvye wu mo nzhii ba evya ela mizhikembo iyi o mbawu. O ma tee akwu umɛ uwoshoshi, umba ba o wiyi tee o fo ɛrama iyi ɔsu ma mo.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Omosisi a nyama tee uwu akwu umɛ uwu umokokpayi uwu ɔsu Ofero kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a bulɔma mo le. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />A nyama kaa la ma inyashi mbala enzu umba Ukpo, ɛlɛ i she wu i ka iyi bɔkɔ a mwɔnyɛ mu ingbomo iyi kwuye bwɛɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />E to ese ikpomo kwuwongu Okrasi i ka ogbo laa ɔnyɛ uwu Izhipiti ma, moo a bɔ eyi mu rigbɛ ingyi a ba na. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Omosis a lafya la Izhipiti ba a wiyi iyi amba umba ɔsu mo. A bɔ eyi wu mu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ o ma wu mo awu akwɛyi e tomo iyi igba kembo. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Akwu mu ikwu idu fulo gba Omosisi a ta ɔkpa laa enzu umba Izirɛ tee lo koko lo wo odumudumu uwu ikalama kaa lo fya ɛnzhi mu lunzugu kaa Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Lukwu uwu oshi la ngbɛ ɛmɛ anzɔnu umba kwonze umba Izirɛ ma mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo gba enzu umba Izirɛ o sa risu ri fyovyo ma kyamate akwu mu ɛzhi iyi ɛwuru tayi; kwuyengwu enzu umba Izhipiti o gyi tee lo fye, akwɛyi embyi o ri mbo mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo gba ɔbɛ uwu Ozheriko u shirimo mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba Izirɛ o fula wu ma afyi erewo le. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo gba Orewabu u to kaya awu o ngbɛ wu ma mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo ilomo laa Ukpo mo le, kwuwongu enzu umba Izirɛlu umba bɔkɔ o lɔ mba ma kaa lo ŋanda ɛzhi ma kyo kyo awu a na mba ma mu ewo epo. <verse eid="HEB 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Mi so te kpɔ? Kwuye kwu yemi gyɔɔ kaa la mi siso iyi Ɔgidiyɔ, Obaraki, Osamisi, Ozhefuta, Odevidi, Ɔsamuwɛ mbala anukenzu lɛɛbi mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo gba o to ewa mbala ɛzhi gyɔɔ akwɛyi o ri mo le. O wo ongbulolo akwɛyi o na kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi mbala mba. O koko lunzu undu abaga ma, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />o nyi ɛtunɛ iyi ɔyi ma, o wirima mbaa ingbɛma iyi ukpandɛrɛ. O finyashi, ba o gba o vindɔ enzu umba ekpasu; o yi ekpasu mu ewa itomo akwɛyi o ri asozha agboga ma. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Akwu mu ikwidufulo gba eko o na enzu mbo umba bɔkɔ o kpomo lareyi le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Umbafo, umba bɔkɔ o tomo kaa lo gba kembo kaa lo lu mba afyima, o kpomo meka iyi inyashi imama kwuwongu kaa lo bo yi mbo mo la kwunyɔ ungwu kwu shika. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Umbafo o wo mbo ɛnɛ akwɛyi o kpa mba izele, umbafo o lo mbo ɛyɛ akwɛyi o to mbo o ka mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />O kpa mbafo ekyi, enzu umbafo o ka mba epo mu ukpandɛrɛ. O kpo ekpo iyi ilɔ mbala i yi ɛmu mɛnwu mu ifulama - o yi rewa, o lo mbo inyashi, akwɛyi o kpa mba ɛmu. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu shoshi kwu shi mbo mo! O fulama mu akata mbala lɔwa, efyo mbala ɛbu mu ɛzhi kyamate aganangba tayi. <verse eid="HEB 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi o she la Ukpo kwuwongu ikwidufulo akwɛyi o wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi! Tetete o na kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi mbala mba dɛ ishi mbo gbomo mo, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />kwuwongu Ukpo e yi kiya ingyi esheshi ingyi ki ka ngyɛlɛ ma. E wo ɛlɛ kaa enzu mbɔlɛ mbala kinzu la ki nyɔlɔma kyaa kwuye kwunyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpo Ete Nzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Kinzu ki yi azɔgɔ riba umba bɔkɔ o fula nzu ma. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la ki ta kiya ingyinangyina ma mbala ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ i gɔ nzu ma, kaa la ki renya iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu keyi nzu ele mu egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />La ki bɔ eyi shɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu bɔkɔ ki kwu idu lu fulo ma wu i na mu iyemo nzhii so mu imbwama. Kwuwongwu ɔnyɛ uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu keyi wu, e yidu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu, e wo lovya undu lukwu undu bɔkɔ e be kpo mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu mo, kekelele ba a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu ukpa uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />La lu yese inyashi iyi bɔkɔ a ma, ewo iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba ingbomo o wo anya wu! Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛnwu li kpo yi mo ka la lu gba kembo mo. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Moo mu igyakpɔɔ yi kaa la lu ingbomo mo, lu du ma inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i ka yi laa lukwu mo. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Lunyi lu ka la kwuleyi iyi iso iyi ɛnwu ikɔma iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so yi lunyi ɛmɛ wu re? A zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">&lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, to yi laa ɔlu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a nɔngɔ ŋɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">uŋɔ ba ki tutu egbo mo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e tu ŋɔ mo mo.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Moo Ukpo a nɔngɔ onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">akwɛyi e tu onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na wu tee akwu umɛ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />La lu yidu kwuyengwu ete yi a nɔngɔ yi ma; inyashi imama yi i zɔ tee Ukpo e ye yi mu iwomo kyamate ɛmɛ wu tayi. I yi umɛ wu bɔkɔ ete wu a zɔ wu rɛnu moo? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Akwiyi gba Ukpo a zɔ yi rɛnu kyamate ɛmɛ wu mo, de ba i zɔ tee lu kwu ɛmɛ wu shɛɛ mo, lu kwu ɛmɛ umba kaya. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kinzu ki lomo laa umba ete nzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ kwuyengwu o zɔ nzu rɛnu. I fate i yi Ete nzu uwu kwundu li ka le kaa la ki yi kwunyɔ! <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Umba ete nzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o zɔ nzu rɛnu kwuye bwɛɛ tabɔkɔ i she mbo tayi; iyi Ukpo ba e wo yi kwuwongu esheshi nzu, kaa la ki yi kɛrikɛri mate uwu tayi. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o zɔ nzu rɛnu awu, ki pwa ofya bwɛɛ, moo akwu ɔnyɛ mo. Mizhikembo yi, umba bɔkɔ o zɔ mba rɛnu awu ba o na imuma iyi idigbomo mbala luzɛ lu toto.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyemalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu yi ewo yi iyi bɔkɔ i kpomo awu ma moshi, kaa la lu shi epunu yi i yi bɔkɔ i yi mu ipwulama awu ekpasu! <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />La lu so wu mu luzɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo, kaa umba bɔkɔ o yi ofya umba alɛ kaa lo fya ekpasu ma.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />La lu gyakpɔɔ kaa la lu ŋɔ moloto mbala uwewe, la lu gba la lu gyakpɔɔ kaa la lu wuluma kɛrikɛri, kwuwongu i yi onzu ukpukpɛnyi tee uwu bɔkɔ a ma Ɔkwu mo gba e yi kɛrikɛri mo. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />La lu ngbɛndu kaa onzu ukpukpɛnyi tee laa lafya la esheshi iyi Ukpo mo. La lu ngbɛndu kaa onzu ukpukpɛnyi yi le yi kyamate kwuwɛyi kwu zɛ wɔnu ungwu kwu ra laa ɛtu ngwu akwɛyi kwu tutu enzu gyɔɔ ma mo. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />La lu ngbɛndu kaa onzu ukpukpɛnyi tee la kwu onzu uwu kaya itomo naa onzu uwu e yi Ukpo mo kyamate Isɔ tayi mo, uwu bɔkɔ kwuwongu kwugbo ungwu ɔwɛ, a ya inzumbɛkɔ wu iyi umɛ uwu kwonze ma awu. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, lu yitu tee, a gyi tee la na esheshi iyi ete wu; uwu ba a fya yi ma mo, kwuwongu a fya ɔgwuzɛ ukpukpɛnyi tee uwu bɔkɔ a gba laa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e wo le inɔngɔma mo, a kpa ɛshɛku laa ɛnyɛ meyi tetete uwu ba a fya yi mo.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Lunyi lu bo mu lɔwa ungwu bɔkɔ o pwa ngwu afyi, mbaa bɔkɔ ɔyi u yi mu ipwumo, ipwu kpakiri mbala kwokpo, kyamate bɔkɔ Izirɛ o ka mu lɔwa undu Osinayi, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />anu iyi kwongangaraki mbala opwu Kwuye ungwu enzu mbamba o pwa opwu ɔnwu akwɛyi o kpa ɛshɛku kaa Ukpo la gba le so mbo iso fo, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Ex 19.12,13</char></note> kwuwongu o domo kaa lo rala iso iyi bɔkɔ e so tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba izɔfyi lala a pwafyi mu lɔwa kwɔngu, lo kpa wu ekyi lo ngbɛ wu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Omosisi mafyi wu iyi i wo wu mo gyɔɔ tabɔkɔ a ma ɛlɛ akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi yi mu ipwulama mbala iyi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Lunyi ba lu bo mu Lɔwa ungwu Ɔzayɔ mbala kwuse ungwu Ukpo ureyi, mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwoshi, mbala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo edubu guruguru o yi mu ɔnyɛ imwuma. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Lu bo mu ɛlu ikpalama iyi ɔnyɛ iyi umɛ ɔnzɔnu uwu kwonze uwu Ukpo, umba bɔkɔ ɛnyi mba o ka yi ma moshi. Lu bo mbaa Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ akwu u zɔ ombu uwu enzu lɛɛbi, mbala ɛndu iyi enzu umba ototo umba bɔkɔ o wo mbo o nyɔlɔma marimari e awu. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Lu bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu u ta meka uwu kenzu igyirima unga epo mbala enzu, mbala mbaa ɛnzhi umba bɔkɔ o fumo bɔkɔ o siso iyi esheshi o ka ɛnzhi umba Ɛbɛlu ma awu.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu ngbɛndu kaa la lu towo iso iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu iso isomo le mo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo iso iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ ilɔ iyi Ukpo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ma awu lala, o vuluma mu rinye mo. I wote bɔkɔ kinzu ki vuluma, akwiyi gba ki kpa ɔsu mu iso iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ moshi awu! <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Opwu wu u wo kwudu kwɔlɛ akpa kwuye kwɔngu, kekelele ba a gyiri kenzu mo tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi gba mi wo kwudu kwɔlɛ akpa kpɔ, tetete akwu ungwu kɛɛkyi ngwu fo, i kyo oshi tete ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Iso iyi i zɔ tee&lt;&lt;kpɔ&gt;&gt; awu i zɔ tee apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo yi awu, o wo yi akpa akwɛyi o ngbɛ yi ma buu, kaa apula iyi bɔkɔ o do yi akpa iwomo awu ba li rima tayi.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, kwuwongu ki na irɛsu iyi bɔkɔ o do yi akpa iwomo mo. La ki mwɔnyɛ kaa la ki gbo Ukpo ɔya mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ u she wu, mbala ilomo mbala iyi; <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />moo Ukpo nzu akwu ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u pwu kiya ma shɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ewo Iyi Bɔkɔ O She Laa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />La lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu kyamate wa mbwalu ngboro tayi. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />La lu lolo kaa lu na agboga yi mu ewo epo, moo enzu umbafo o wo tayi ba o yitu tee akwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mo. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />La lu lolo enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ugu ugyi awu, kyamate lu yi mɔmɔ mbala mba tayi. La lu lolo enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu inyashi imama, kyamate lu yi mu inyashi imama kyamate mba tayi.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Uwewe le shi igba laa ɔnu iyama mbala oko itomo, oko mbala ɔnu lo kwidu lo fulo mesu. Ukpo a zɔ ombu laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o yama mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o to kaya.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />La lu ngbɛndu, la lu kpoluku undu eduwo mo, kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu yi ngyi la ki do yi mo. Moo Ukpo a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi lu yi afyima mo; ba Mi towo yi mo mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la ki so mu egbo ikpɛnyi tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu akwu u mbwami ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Imi mi riyi mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Kimbe bɔkɔ onzu e do te e wo mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />La lu lolo wa to keyi yi umba kwonze umba bɔkɔ o zɔ yi iso iyi Ukpo awu. La lu lolo apula iyi esheshi lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo mbala lukwu mbo kaa la lu mondo ikwu idu lu fulo mbo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e yi mule, e yi ɔnɛ, ba e yi iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />La lu shi kaa ɛzɔ iyepo ikikɔ ikikɔ li to yi mo mu ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo mo. I shoshi kaa la lu na ekpasu mba esheshi iyi Ukpo, moo lakwu mbaa ɛrama iyi kiya ingyirimo imbwaluma mo; enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ɛrama ɛnyi, i mbwa mba ma mo.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Eboshi umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma mu riyi ingyi Ukpo ilɛma ingyi Azhu o yi ekpasu iyi o ri kiya ingyi isabɔ mu kwumbu ungwu isabɔ nzu mo. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ebwoshi umba Ukpo umbakɔ umba Azhu o nya la ɛnzhi umba izɔfyi mu Riyi Ingyi Ri Ka Kɛrikɛri le awu kaa lo wo isabɔ iyi ingbomo, ivye iyi izɔfyi mbamba ba o pwu yi mo mizhikembo iyi kwunu. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba Ɔzhizɔsi e kpomo mizhikembo iyi kwuse le tete, kaa la ra la ɛnzhi wu la gbɔ ingbomo iyi enzu mo. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la ki so mizhikembo iyi kwunu kaa la ki shi lovya mbala wu kyakya. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Moo kwudu kwɔlɛ akwu kwogba nzu mo, kinzu ki yi mu eyifulomo iyi kwogba ungwu kwu yi mu inyɔma. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ kinzu la ki du Ukpo ma iyɔkpɔɔ, inyi gba akwu isabɔ nzu iyi i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi le, inyi gba akwu reshi ingyi amu itama mbala Ukpo iduma tee uwu gba akwu Ɔkwu le. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />La lu kalakwuleyi iyi esheshi iwomo mbala imbwama lesu mo, kwuwongu ɛlɛ gba akwu isabɔ iyi bɔkɔ i she laa Ukpo le.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />La lu lomo laa watekeyi yi, la lu mbwalu ɔkpa mba. Umba o bɔ eyi ma yi ba o yi ɛnwu igbomo mo, kwuwongu akwu mega o so ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo laa Ukpo. Akwiyi gba lu lo mbo mo, oo wo ɛduma mba la ɔnyɛ; gba akwu tayi yi mo, umba o wo ɛduma mba la egbo igyi, ɛnyi ba i mbwa yi ma mo.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />La lu gyakpɔɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma kwuwo nzu. Moo egbo nzu akwu ikpɛnyi, kwuwongu ki gyi tee la ki wo iyesheshi kwuyengwunanguna. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Mi kpa yi ɛshɛku tee la lu gyakpɔɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma kaa li to kwuye gyɔɔ mo kaa Ukpo la lɔ mi la mi gba mi so munyi yi.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpo Ilɛma Mbala Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Ukpo uwu idigbomo, uwu bɔkɔ i zɛ mu ɛnzhi umba kenzu igyirima unga ɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ, uwu bɔkɔ a gba laa Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi iyimo mu lukwu, uwu bɔkɔ akwu U gbo Ilɔ Uwakwu awu, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />le shi yi ekpasu kaa lu wo esheshi iyi bɔkɔ a gyi. Le shi yi ekpasu i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kaa la ki wo kiya ingyi ki she wu. inzumbɛku akwu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ! Ami.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso Imbwambwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Mi kpa yi ɛshɛku, ɛmɛnɛ mi, tee la lu shi alu mu rɛnu ingyi ɛnwu ikama ngyɛlɛ; moo kwupwu kwɔlɛ ungwu mi ka yi ngwu ele kwu yi wɔzhi mo. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mi gyi tee la lu yitu tee umanyi nzu Otimoti o wa wu ma mu ugu ugyi e. Akwiyi gba e bo efyefya, mi nyɔ mbala wu munyi yi.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />La lu gbɛlɛ wa tekeyi yi ɛnyi lɛɛbi mbala enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi. Wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Itali awu o zɔ tee lɔ gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Esheshi iyi Ukpo li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>